Please run these steps in order:
1. git init (if not already initialized)
2. git remote add origin https://github.com/[company]/[repo-name].git
3. git checkout -b feature/[branch name]
4. git add .
5. git commit -m "feat: [your change description]"
6. git push origin feature/[branch name]
7. Use gh pr create to open a PR targeting the main branch

